{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"After an SSD move, assign a letter to the ~260 MB FAT EFI volume, bootrec /fixboot, then rebuild BCD with bcdboot.","label":"Migrate to SSD","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/license","label":"License","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/license"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/monitor_power_management","label":"Monitor Power","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/monitor_power_management"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRepair the EFI bootloader after migrating Windows to an SSD. Walkthrough:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>http:\/\/www.fixedbyvonnie.com\/2013\/12\/how-to-repair-the-efi-bootloader-in-windows-8\/<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: this rewrites the boot record and replaces the BCD store.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Assign the drive letter<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGive the small FAT EFI volume a letter (<code class='inline'>v:<\/code> here):\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>diskpart\nsel disk 0\nlist vol\nsel vol &lt;FAT_~260 MB&gt;\nassign letter=v:\nexit<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Repair the boot record<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cd \/d v:\\EFI\\Microsoft\\Boot\\\nbootrec \/fixboot<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Rebuild the BCD store<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRename the existing BCD, then rebuild for <code class='inline'>c:\\Windows<\/code> with locale <code class='inline'>en-us<\/code>, system volume <code class='inline'>v:<\/code>, firmware ALL:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ren BCD BCD.old\nbcdboot c:\\Windows \/l en-us \/s v: \/f ALL<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/migrate_to_ssd\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/migrate_to_ssd\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/license' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/license' data-title='License' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>License<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/monitor_power_management' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/monitor_power_management' data-title='Monitor Power' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Monitor Power<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/windows.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Windows<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}